	(text "USB GOBEGI (USB2514B, 24 MHz; PC adaptorundeki devre): Jetson USB1'den dort port. 1: kumanda islemcisi (giris karti), 2: guc islemcisi,"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 380 28 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "1788f9a9-d2f8-55d5-a04b-407e843c25ac")
	)
	(text "Yer radyosu (Ground Radio), Base ve bilgisayar bu porttan baglanir. Orta uclar: Jetson tarafi 100n -> GND, kablo tarafi 75R -> 1 nF 2 kV."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30 256 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "277c33d3-519a-54e0-a4f2-3784ab918468")
	)
	(text "M.2 NVMe (Key M, PCIE0, dort serit; Vision ile ayni): soketin PER uclari Jetson'in alicilarina dogrudan, PET uclari vericilerine 220 nF ile."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30 28 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "4ee54177-9ee8-546d-a38c-837a070c7f45")
	)
	(text "DIS USB-A PORTU (TPS2051C, 0,5 A) ve DOKUNMATIK EKRAN USB'si (JST-GH 4: +5 V, D-, D+, GND). Ikisi de Jetson acikken beslenir."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 380 290 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "51f4a9e8-7bf1-55c0-801d-57bd384ccdaf")
	)
	(text "3: dokunmatik ekran konnektoru, 4: dis USB-A (0,5 A sinirli). Gobek surekli beslenir ama Jetson'in 3,3 V'u yokken sifirlamada tutulur."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 380 34 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "930ae812-269d-5543-85a9-bd612f682dd5")
	)
	(text "OMURGA ETHERNET'I (Vision ile ayni): Jetson'in kendi gigabit portu trafo (TG111-MSC13LF) uzerinden omurga fisinin dort ciftine gider."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30 250 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "c111edcf-ee8c-5390-84ed-10cc72824fc5")
	)
	(text "FAN (5 V, 4 uclu: GND, +5V, devir, PWM; Vision ile ayni): PWM Jetson'dan; Jetson kapaliyken 10k asagi cekme fani durdurur."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30 490 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "c83759f5-5f19-5ff6-94d9-0c9030a38026")
	)
	(text "SEVIYE CEVIRICI (TXS0104E, 1,8 V <-> 3,3 V): Jetson UART1 <-> guc islemcisi (USART1), fan PWM (GPIO14). Jetson kapaliyken uclarini birakir."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30 400 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "d5186e95-6917-5564-8797-b854ed6e4f23")
	)
